title: Salty Dog Blues
key: G
type: song
form: verse/chorus
feel: 2/4, fast
rights: unknown
cue: "Standin' on the corner with the low down blues"
notes: Ragtime circle: 1 – 6 – 2 – 5. Kick-off over the chorus.
notes: Ending: tag the last line of the chorus.
verified: false
break: Lean on the major 3rd of each chord in the circle (the 3rd of the 6, 2 and 5 chords) — that's the ragtime sound.
break.guitar: Bass-note runs into each change; finish with a G-run on the last 1.
break.mandolin: Double-stop the chord tones and slide into each new chord a half step below.

